 now retries when the server returns 503. It makes at most 3 attempts in total, and the wait between attempts doubles each time.\n\nChanges in `weather.py`:\n- Waits are 0.5s and then 1s. The starting wait is set by a new `backoff` constructor argument (default `0.5`).\n- If the third attempt also gets a 503, it raises the usual `HTTPError`.\n- Any other HTTP error, such as a 500, fails straight away with no retry.\n- Network errors and timeouts (`URLError`, socket timeout) are also not retried, since you only asked for 503s.\n- The limit is a class attribute, `MAX_ATTEMPTS = 3`.\n\nI tested it against a local HTTP server with a short backoff:\n- 503, 503, then 200: returned the data after 3 calls.\n- 503 every time: raised `HTTPError 503` after exactly 3 calls.\n- 500: raised straight away after 1 call.\n- 200: returned on the first call.\n\nNo test file was added, because the repo doesn't have a test suite.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 1, "replies_ok": 5, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 105075, "requests_cache_write": 73050, "requests_cost_usd": 0.41741300000000003, "requests_count": 5, "requests_input_uncached": 12, "requests_output": 1555, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-netclient:claude-opus-5-5:trial11", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 81, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-20T03:48:39.567428+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 21.181, "t_checker_s": 1.879, "t_env_setup_s": 0.0, "task": "trig-omp-netclient", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "off", "thinking_sent": ["none", "none", "none", "none", "none"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1567, "tokens_cache_read": 105075, "tokens_cache_writ